    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-lookup-start",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-lookup-start",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "为什么需要一个固定入口",
        "markdown": "文件系统要从磁盘读取任何内容，都必须先找到一个固定且已知的位置作为入口。LFS 把 inode 映射拆成多块并分散写入磁盘，最新版本的 inode 还会不断移动，因此不能像 inode 数组那样直接按固定地址计算。检查点区域正是为解决这个入口问题而设置的。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000609"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "廉价冗余磁盘阵列（RAID）",
                "检查点区域"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11894,
              "lineEnd": 11903,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2719d53f4b9fdf49c4950e8d69b4ca54c1b5b36a11901187213f11cca2cffee9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-fixed-anchor",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-lookup-start",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充直觉：不动的索引台",
        "markdown": "可以把检查点区域想成图书馆的索引入口：入口本身必须固定在读者知道的位置，入口后面指向的书架却可以随整理而移动。LFS 的其他结构之所以能到处移动，是因为始终有一个不动的起点指向它们。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-lookup-start"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-cr-definition",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint-region-structure",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "检查点区域的定义",
        "markdown": "检查点区域（checkpoint region，CR）是 LFS 在磁盘上唯一固定的位置。它保存指向最新 inode 映射片段的指针（即地址），因此 LFS 可以先读取 CR，再顺着指针找到分散在各处的 imap 片段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000609"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "廉价冗余磁盘阵列（RAID）",
                "检查点区域"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11894,
              "lineEnd": 11903,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2719d53f4b9fdf49c4950e8d69b4ca54c1b5b36a11901187213f11cca2cffee9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-cr-indirection",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint-region-structure",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充澄清：CR 只保存指针",
        "markdown": "注意 CR 保存的是指针，不是完整的 inode 映射，更不是文件数据。它只承担入口和转发地址的职责，真正的 inode 地址仍由 imap 块给出。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-cr-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-disk-layout",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint-region-structure",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "整体磁盘布局",
        "markdown": "从整体布局看，磁盘开头有一个检查点区域，它指向 inode 映射的最新部分；每个 inode 映射块记录相应 inode 的磁盘地址；inode 再指向文件（以及目录）的数据块。这样，CR → imap 块 → inode → 数据块就构成一条可逐级解析的定位链。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000609"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "廉价冗余磁盘阵列（RAID）",
                "检查点区域"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11894,
              "lineEnd": 11903,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2719d53f4b9fdf49c4950e8d69b4ca54c1b5b36a11901187213f11cca2cffee9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-layout-chain",
        "moduleId": "checkpoint-region-structure",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充说明：每一级只负责下一级地址",
        "markdown": "把这条链看成多级指针：CR 只知道 imap 片段在哪里，imap 块只知道 inode 在哪里，inode 才知道文件数据在哪里。读取时逐级查表，任何一级都不需要保存后面所有层级的完整内容。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-disk-layout"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-update-policy",
        "moduleId": "update-policy-and-performance",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "定期更新策略",
        "markdown": "检查点区域只定期更新，例如大约每 30 秒更新一次。这样既保留了固定入口的作用，又不需要在每次写入时都去更新这个固定位置，因而不会明显拖累写入性能。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000609"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "廉价冗余磁盘阵列（RAID）",
                "检查点区域"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11894,
              "lineEnd": 11903,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "2719d53f4b9fdf49c4950e8d69b4ca54c1b5b36a11901187213f11cca2cffee9"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-update-tradeoff",
        "moduleId": "update-policy-and-performance",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "补充权衡：定期更新换来稳定开销",
        "markdown": "定期更新的本质是用少量「入口信息可能稍旧」的代价，换取固定位置写入的低开销。如果 CR 随每次写入同步更新，这个固定位置就会成为频繁更新的热点，带来额外开销。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-update-policy"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-misconceptions",
        "moduleId": "trace-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "常见误解与纠正",
        "markdown": "两个常见误解需要纠正：一是以为检查点区域保存了全部 inode 或完整 imap 内容，它实际只保存指向最新 imap 片段的指针；二是以为每次写入都要立刻更新 CR，它实际只定期更新。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-cr-definition",
            "textbook-update-policy"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-example-chain",
        "moduleId": "trace-and-check",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材示例：一次完整的地址解析",
        "markdown": "教材给出的示例中，CR 位于磁盘开头、地址为 0，并记录 imap[k…k+N] 的地址 A2；地址 A2 处的 imap 块给出 inode k 的地址 A1；地址 A1 处的 inode 给出数据块 D 的地址 A0。真实文件系统会有更大的 CR、多个 imap 块以及更多 inode 和数据块。",
        "provenance": {
